v 3
d fereg: fast HDFE OLS/IV, PPML and logit (Rust plugin)
d
d fereg (OLS and IV/2SLS), feppml (Poisson pseudo-maximum likelihood) and felogit (logit)
d estimate models with any number of absorbed high-dimensional fixed effects, heterogeneous
d slopes, weights and multiway clustering. Syntax, estimates and stored results follow reghdfe,
d ivreghdfe and ppmlhdfe; felogit's incidental-parameter bias corrections and average partial
d effects follow logitfe. The estimation core is a compiled Rust plugin (Linux, macOS, Windows).
d
d Author: Leo Liu, auleo.liu@gmail.com
d License: MIT
d Distribution-Date: 20261015
